886b1035727675a73276b426e9de9b04a4ffed5c3ee77db8dcd02260d63ab6","download_count":118,"created_at":"2026-11-26T10:57:04Z","updated_at":"2026-11-26T10:57:04Z"},{"id":795469772,"node_id":"RA_kwDOKxH29M4vaefM","name":"SHA512SUMS","label":"","uploader":{"login":"cursor[bot]","id":206951365,"node_id":"BOT_kgDODFXTxQ","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":3306,"digest":"sha256:a452183b8da28f9cdf12c2dcd9155dae8260ac26ce1d2936453caecca1e34b6a","download_count":6,"created_at":"2026-11-26T10:57:04Z","updated_at":"2026-11-26T10:57:04Z"}],"body":"<!-- rustfs-generated-release-notes: managed; remove this marker before manual edits -->\n## What's Changed\n* fix(storage): backport scanner recovery and ordered shard reads by @overtrue in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9512\n* fix(scanner): resume wide directory scans on release 1.0.7 by @cxymds in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9523\n* fix(scanner): backport usage and recovery fixes to 1.0.7 by @cxymds in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9531\n* fix(storage): bound delete recovery and guard legacy residue cleanup by @cxymds in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9534\n* fix(storage): backport replacement heal and scanner fixes to 1.0.7 by @cxymds in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9533\n* fix(ilm): continue tier recovery past unreadable objects in 1.0.7 by @cxymds in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9539\n* fix(iam): backport Console STS password rotation to 1.0.7 by @cxymds in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9536\n* fix(admin): report inventory coverage and cluster scanner activity on 1.0.7 by @cxymds in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9540\n* fix(scanner): preserve discovery progress across owner cancellation by @cxymds in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9546\n* feat(scanner): expose durable bucket scan progress by @cxymds in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9548\n* fix(scanner): restore release CI and preserve admin response contracts by @overtrue in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9555\n* fix(scanner): preserve durable progress on wide and changing buckets by @overtrue in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9552\n* fix(heal): retry busy bucket repairs after a node restart by @overtrue in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9562\n* fix(scanner): reuse sealed page names during directory enumeration by @overtrue in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9564\n* fix(scanner): fence prefix usage cache fills across invalidation by @overtrue in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9566\n* fix(scanner): preserve inventory and maintenance coverage by @overtrue in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9567\n* fix(scanner): recertify legacy usage after cold restart by @cxymds in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9573\n* fix(scanner): resume checkpoints and expose partial progress by @cxymds in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9583\n* fix(scanner): preserve checkpoint coverage across handoffs by @cxymds in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9587\n* fix(scanner): preserve completed usage and publish initial progress by @cxymds in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9592\n* fix(decommission): keep scanner progress on its owning set by @cxymds in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9603\n* fix(sts): validate root credentials on 1.0.7 startup by @houseme in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9604\n* fix(sts): validate root credentials and report parent access denials (1.0.7) by @houseme in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9605\n* fix(ecstore): make release directory walks iterative by @houseme in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9608\n* fix(scanner): backport tier registry replan to 1.0.7 by @cxymds in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9616\n* fix(sts): backport inline session policy Id support to 1.0.7 by @GatewayJ in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9614\n* fix(kms,sse): backport KMS and SSE fixes to 1.0.7 by @reatang in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9613\n* fix(scanner): walk directories with an explicit stack by @cxymds in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9623\n* fix(replication): verify probe cleanup against target versions by @cxymds in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9624\n* fix(s3): restore 1.0.7 compatibility and batch delete correctness by @cxymds in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9622\n* fix(ecstore): backport bulk delete repair to 1.0.7 by @houseme in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9633\n* fix(ecstore): gate rebalance test fixtures on test-util by @houseme in https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/pull/9634\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/rustfs/rustfs/compare/1.0.6...1.0.7\n","reactions":{"total_count":6,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":5}
